    A('S20_086','S27_pv_note','The 10% entries use the strict precision audit in Table 24; other eligibility cases retain their original solver settings. The no-BESS utilisation gain is an LP result, unchanged to 2.9 × 10<sup>−14</sup> percentage points in the paired contrast after tightening tolerances. In the primary BESS case, the optimal PV-use contrasts are zero to numerical precision; tiny final signed differences arise within the lexicographic lock.','10% 行采用表 24 的严格精度核查；其他参与情景保留原求解设置。无储能利用率增益来自线性规划，收紧容差后配对差异的最大变化为 2.9 × 10<sup>−14</sup> 个百分点。主储能情景的最优 PV 利用对比在数值精度内为零；最终微小的有符号差异位于字典序锁定容差范围内。')
    U('S20_065',by['S20_065']['en']+' The 10% primary points and no-BESS GPU20 hosting point use the strict repeat audit; other points retain the original settings (Table 24).',by['S20_065']['zh']+' 主 10% 数据点和 GPU20 无储能接纳点采用严格重算；其他点保留原设置（表 24）。')
    A('S26_8_caption','S27_F9_title','### Supplementary Figure 9 | Independent qualification under reference and observed-week inputs','### 补充图 9 | 参考输入与观测周输入的独立资格检验')
    A('S26_8_caption','S27_F9_image','![Supplementary Figure 9](../docs/figures/commitment_validation_v1/artwork/AIDRBench_Supplementary_Figure_9.png)','![补充图 9](../docs/figures/commitment_validation_v1/artwork/AIDRBench_Supplementary_Figure_9.png)')
    A('S26_8_caption','S27_F9_caption',
      '**a,** Independently confirmed four- and eight-hour reference-distribution offers of 5.60 and 4.42 kW (300 scenarios each), retained from the preceding figure set. **b,** Development lower bounds across every candidate for count and resource-time weighting (100 new draws each); solid circles show the 1% standard and dashed squares the zero-miss standard; both select the same offer within each weight. **c,** Independent confirmation for the two selected offers and the fixed 2.95-kW resource-time comparator (300 new draws each). Points show success fractions and lower whiskers one-sided 95% Wilson bounds. Dashed lines mark the 0.95 qualification criterion. b,c condition on an equal empirical mixture of eight fixed observed weeks, paired synthetic tasks and call phases; they do not expand the number of observed weeks. All calls last eight hours with 16-h start spacing in b,c. a uses a different reference workload distribution.',
      '**a，** 参考分布四小时与八小时报价 5.60、4.42 kW 的独立确认，各 300 个情景，保留自上一版图组。**b，** 次数和资源时间加权的所有候选报价开发下界，各 100 次新抽样。实线圆点为 1% 标准，虚线方点为零漏期标准；每种权重的两种标准选中相同报价。**c，** 两个选定报价及资源时间固定 2.95 kW 比较请求的独立确认，各 300 次新抽样。点为成功比例，下须为单侧 95% Wilson 下界，虚线为 0.95 资格标准。b,c 以八个固定观测周的等权经验混合分布、配对合成任务及调用相位为条件，并未增加观测周数量；调用时长均为八小时、开始间隔 16 h。a 使用另一种参考工作负载分布。')
