    tab='\n'.join(lines);zh=tab.replace('Peak (kW)','峰值（kW）').replace('5.90 kW / peak (%)','5.90 kW / 峰值（%）').replace('4 h zero successes','4 h 零漏期成功').replace('8 h zero successes','8 h 零漏期成功').replace('Minimum PCC headroom (kW)','最小接入余量（kW）');A('S24_T21_note','S27_T23_data',tab,zh)
    A('S24_T21_note','S27_T23_note','The four- and eight-hour repeated schedules retain requests of 5.603331 and 4.423682 kW; the 5.898243-kW column is a single-event accounting comparison. Each row re-scores the same 600 frozen schedules after adding a constant to both controlled and baseline power. It establishes feasible operating witnesses at those requests, without a new controller selection or independent trial. All original success flags are preserved, including failures. The PCC rating remains 1,100 kW.','四小时与八小时重复调度分别保持 5.603331 和 4.423682 kW 请求；5.898243 kW 一列是单次事件的核算比较。每行对相同 600 条冻结调度的响应与基线功率同时加常数后重新评分，得到这些请求下的运行可行见证，没有新的控制器选择或独立试验。全部原成功标记均保留，包括失败。接入额定限额仍为 1,100 kW。')
