    zh=tab.replace('Quantity','指标').replace('Strict result','严格结果').replace('Numerical evidence','数值证据').replace('no BESS','无储能').replace('BESS','储能').replace('hosting gain','接纳增益').replace('LP; all 200 solves optimal','线性规划，200 次均最优').replace('Minimum-bound interval width','最小边界区间宽度').replace('mean utilisation gain','平均利用率增益').replace('95% paired interval','95% 配对区间').replace('Maximum paired change','最大配对变化').replace('Numerical zero; final signed mean','数值零；最终有符号均值').replace('Mean primary-objective contrast bounds','平均主目标差异界');A('S24_T21_note','S27_T24_data',tab,zh)
    A('S24_T21_note','S27_T24_note','Strict options: relative/absolute MIP gaps 1e−7, primal/dual/MIP feasibility tolerances 1e−8, one thread and 120 s per solve. All 400 fixed-PV programmes and 400 no-BESS hosting problems resolved. Of 200 BESS hosting problems, 166 resolved and 34 flexible cases reached the limit. For a maximisation problem, feasible values bound the optimum from below and dual values from above. Taking minima of each bound across all 100 cases bounds the all-scenario hosting boundary; all unresolved cases had feasible capacities above the resolved limiting case. Thus all cases remain included. Mean PV-use contrasts use primary-objective bounds, whereas final utilisation includes the 1e−5-kWh lexicographic lock. Sampling intervals exclude numerical error.','严格选项为相对/绝对 MIP gap 1e−7、原始/对偶/MIP 可行性容差 1e−8、一个线程及每次 120 s。400 项固定 PV 程序与 400 项无储能接纳问题全部完成。200 项储能接纳问题中，166 项完成，34 项灵活情景达到时限。最大化问题的可行值给出最优值下界，对偶值给出上界；分别对全部 100 个情景的上下界取最小，即得到全情景接纳边界的上下界。所有未完成情景的可行容量均高于已求解的限制情景，因此全部情景均保留。平均 PV 利用差异采用主目标界，最终利用率还包含 1e−5 kWh 字典序锁定容差。抽样区间不含数值误差。')
